  "img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-pistol-flintlock-metal.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>属性值加成</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>体型</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>速度</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>选择一项：</p><p>(a)选择一项属性+2;选择一项不同的属性+1 (b)选择三项不同的属性+1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>中等</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30尺；与你步行速度相同的游泳速度。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Astral Spark\"><h3>生物类型 Creature Type。</h3><p> 你是类人生物。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">体型 Size。</strong> 你的体型为中型。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">速度 Speed。</strong> 你的步行速度为30尺，你拥有与你步行速度相同的游泳速度。</p><h3>星界火花 Astral Spark。</h3><p> 你与星光位面的精神连接让你拥有一簇神力火花的神秘权能，并通过你的武器来引导之。当你使用简易或军用武器命中一个目标时，你能对目标额外造成等同于你熟练加值点的力场伤害。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你能使用此特质的次数等同于你的熟练加值，但每回合中只能使用一次。当你完成一次长休后，你重获全部已消耗的使用次数。</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Firearms Mastery\"><h3>枪械精通 Firearms Mastery。</h3><p> 你和枪械有一种神秘的联系，这背后的渊源可追寻至诘弗人那钟情枪械的神祇们。因为祂们，你拥有所有枪械的熟练项，并无视任何枪械的 <strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">装填loading</strong> 属性。此外，使用枪械攻击最大射程内的敌人时，你的远程武器攻击检定不会因为超过常规射程具有劣势。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\"><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">河马体格 Hippo Build。</strong> 你在进行基于力量的属性检定与力量豁免时具有优势。此外，当决定你的载货量和推，拉，抬的重量时，你的体型视为比当前大一级。</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><strong style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">语言 Languages</strong><br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">你的角色能够说、读和写通用语和另一种你和 DM 认为适合该角色的语言。《玩家手册》提供了一项可供选择的泛用语言列表。DM 能自由地为特定战役从列表中去掉或增加语言。</p></div><p>诘弗人身材高大，肩膀宽阔，具有类似河马的特征。有些诘弗人的皮肤很光滑，而另一些诘弗人的脸上和头顶上有短鬃毛。作为具有令人印象深刻的体型和令人难忘的外表的生物，诘弗人无论走到何处都尤为醒目。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">大多数诘弗人都相信他们起源于同一个世界，但现在他们的家乡世界只是传说中的故事，因为没有活着的诘弗人见过它或知道它在哪里。创造诘弗人的神性存在也同样地被遗忘了。他们巨大的石化身躯漂浮在星界海中，与世隔绝且其形态也已无可辨认。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">虽然他们没有意识到这一点，但诘弗人之所以被吸引到星光位面，是因为在深层的精神层面上，他们仍然与他们的造物主保持着联系，们身上残留的神性火花刚好足够为诘弗人注入它们自己的火花，而诘弗人已经学会通过他们的武器来引导这些火花。大多数诘弗人并不知道这种所谓的星界火花来自何处，但当他们身处荒宇或星界海时，他们会无比强烈地感受到它的存在。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\">关于他们的名字如何发音，诘弗人分为两个阵营。一半的诘弗人认为该念 jié ，而另一半认为念 jí （原文，重g和轻g，发音类似拼音gi和ji），对正确发音的分歧往往会演变成激烈的争论，大声的争吵，以及用头互撞的争斗，但他们的争论往往会点到此为止。</p><table class=\"w-100 summary stripe-even\"><tbody><tr><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Ability Scores</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Size</p></th><th class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\"><p>Speed</p></th></tr><tr><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Choose one of: (a) Choose any +2; choose any other +1 (b) Choose three different +1</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>Medium</p></td><td class=\"ve-text-center\"><p>30 ft., swim equal to your walking speed</p></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Astral Spark\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Astral Spark.</span> Your psychic connection to the Astral Plane enables you to mystically access a spark of divine power, which you can channel through your weapons. When you hit a target with a <span class=\"bold\">simple or martial weapon</span>, you can cause the target to take extra force damage equal to your proficiency bonus.</p><p>You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, but you can use it no more than once per turn. You regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Firearms Mastery\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Firearms Mastery.</span> You have a mystical connection to firearms that traces back to the gods of the giff, who delighted in such weapons. You have proficiency with all firearms and ignore the loading property of any firearm. In addition, attacking at long range with a firearm doesn't impose disadvantage on your attack roll.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hippo Build\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hippo Build.</span> You have advantage on Strength-based ability checks and Strength saving throws. In addition, you count as one size larger when determining your carrying capacity and the weight you can push, drag, or lift.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Languages\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Languages.</span> You can speak, read, and write Common and one other language that you and your DM agree is appropriate for your character.</p></div><p>Giff are tall, broad-shouldered folk with hippo-like features. Some have smooth skin, while others have short bristles on their faces and the tops of their heads. As beings of impressive size and unforgettable appearance, giff are noticed wherever they go.</p><p>Most giff believe they originated on one world, but their home world is now the stuff of legend, because no living giff has seen it or knows where it is. The divine beings who created giff have likewise been forgotten. Their titanic petrified bodies drift on the Astral Sea, isolated and unrecognizable in their current forms.</p><p>Although they don't realize it, giff are drawn to the Astral Plane because, on a deep psychic level, they remain connected to their creator gods, who have just enough divine spark left in them to imbue giff with sparks of their own, which giff have learned to channel through their weapons. Most giff have no idea where this so-called astral spark comes from, but they feel its presence most strongly when they are in Wildspace or the Astral Sea.</p><p>Giff are split into two camps concerning how their name is pronounced. Half of them say it with a hard g, half with a soft g. Disagreements over the correct pronunciation often blossom into hard feelings, loud arguments, and head-butting contests, but they rarely escalate beyond that.</p>",
